<com.inphonik.RX1200 name="Havin Illusions" author="William Lamy / Inphonik" comment="Picture yourself behind the wheel of a lowrider in Southern California. You feel the heat on your face and the tension in the air as you cruise along the gang-infested streets. You turn up the volume of your stereo and nod your head to the beat. You see people fearing your ride as you pass by. You are part of a war, a struggle, a life.">
